# What ships to consumers who run `composer require siol-data/linkml-connector`.
#
# Packagist builds the dist from GitHub's zipball of the tagged commit, and that
# is the whole repository unless paths are export-ignored here. Measured before
# this file: 1328 files / 7.7 MB installed, for a 2.2 MB library.
#
# `archive.exclude` in composer.json does not fix this: it only applies to
# archives Composer builds itself (a git/source install), not to a dist
# download. This file is what fixes the common case.
#
# Written as an explicit exclude list rather than "ignore everything, then
# un-ignore the keepers" because negative patterns in .gitattributes are only
# honoured by newer git, and an archive that silently gains the monorepo is a
# bad failure mode.
#
# Only the PHP connector ships. The TypeScript connector (jsr.io) and the Ruby
# gem have their own registries and manifests; the LinkML schema, generators,
# docs and the cross-connector harness are development inputs, not anything a
# PHP consumer loads.
#
# Keep: composer.json, php-connector/LICENSE, php-connector/README.md,
#       php-connector/src, php-connector/contexts, php-connector/vocabularies.
# contexts and vocabularies are read from disk at runtime (Connector.php
# resolves __DIR__/../vocabularies and __DIR__/../contexts), so they must ship.
# The root LICENSE and README.md are excluded deliberately: the root README
# documents the monorepo, not the PHP package, and php-connector ships its own
# README and the MIT notice. Packagist still renders the root README on the
# package page -- it reads that from the repository, not from the archive.

/.gitattributes          export-ignore
/.github/               export-ignore
/.gitignore             export-ignore
/.opencode/             export-ignore
/AGENTS.md              export-ignore
/agents.md              export-ignore
/Makefile               export-ignore
/README.md              export-ignore
/config/                export-ignore
/docs/                  export-ignore
/docs-site/             export-ignore
/scripts/               export-ignore
/shacl/                 export-ignore
/src/                   export-ignore
/tests/                 export-ignore
/ruby-gem/              export-ignore
/typescript-connector/  export-ignore

/php-connector/composer.json   export-ignore
/php-connector/phpunit.xml    export-ignore
/php-connector/tests/         export-ignore
/php-connector/.gitignore     export-ignore
